  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="logo">R</div>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="updated">Radix Calculator · Last updated: June 7, 2026</div>
    </header>

    <p>This Privacy Policy explains how the Radix Calculator app ("Radix", "we",
    "us") handles information when you use the app. By using Radix you agree to
    the practices described below.</p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <div class="card">
      <p>Radix does <strong>not</strong> require an account and does not ask you
      for personal information such as your name, email, or phone number.</p>
      <p>Your calculations and calculation history are stored <strong>only on
      your device</strong> and are never transmitted to us.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <div class="card">
      <p>Radix displays advertisements through <strong>Google AdMob</strong>. To
      serve ads, Google and its partners may collect and process certain data,
      including a device advertising identifier (IDFA), approximate location
      derived from IP address, device type, and ad interaction data. This may be
      used to deliver and measure personalized or non-personalized ads.</p>
      <p>On first launch the app asks for your permission to track (App Tracking
      Transparency). If you decline, you will still see ads, but they will be
      non-personalized.</p>
      <p>Learn how Google uses data:
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a>.
      You can manage ad personalization in your device <em>Settings → Privacy &amp;
      Security → Tracking</em> and <em>Apple Advertising</em>.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Data sharing</h2>
    <div class="card">
      <p>We do not sell your personal information. Data collected for advertising
      is processed by Google AdMob in accordance with its own privacy policy:
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">policies.google.com/privacy</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <div class="card">
      <p>Radix is not directed at children under 13 and we do not knowingly
      collect personal information from them.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Decline tracking via the App Tracking Transparency prompt or in iOS Settings.</li>
      <li>Reset your advertising identifier in iOS Settings at any time.</li>
      <li>Delete the app to remove all locally stored data, including history.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <div class="card">
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be
      posted on this page with an updated date.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <div class="card">
      <p>Questions about this policy? Email
      <a href="mailto:ahedkrakra1@gmail.com">ahedkrakra1@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </div>

